", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "bMfJOK.png", "id": "1884748081659935", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982670_1884748084993268_1845827882685825024_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X0yd0mVPU-wQ7kNvwFCuHgW&_nc_oc=Adpqt8xON-PKbg1wZ28aW-fmGuzktJvK7qWF_XiYjNKa6-Dbys5AMWxyOTg3jcL-R5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8cawQRMtcvP9wpm_N2pFdaG2J0jRTxD2-NfZrleaBK7A&oe=6A2810C2"}, {"file_name": "1gRrYe.png", "id": "649494149168060", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974624_649494152501393_4889968777875161088_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OYRGxGjV2pgQ7kNvwFYZORt&_nc_oc=AdqZ7m6_3OnZoaI1pb1qUg8W006F9_qaMBJRvRCOSfXlwK4Ocb92ZpAtINHnV2M4H88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8sxAu8TJgyXb9LAz0Hj9IuDN-AFCDcDXMuJ1l7T0WdBQ&oe=6A283918"}, {"file_name": "PS1tWP.png", "id": "223941032361146", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974555_223941035694479_8181425666768502784_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z3BqDWc_nUIQ7kNvwHAqJSq&_nc_oc=AdppOIREs7zPU3XtO3SnV-Z6Wifz2L8X_XdJJfD4CqzcTsQ2q1sVBwYrLM5wkmIDvkI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8TAQbKXz08OawKPEudUWxtQfCnnV7wnhzaMRn9a6qifA&oe=6A281DC8"}, {"file_name": "d5e4uO.png", "id": "233096617897309", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982699_233096621230642_1541719454822432768_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RRqZZGoaT2EQ7kNvwGJ8Nq9&_nc_oc=Adrt055I3ZlavjyWdF-3QXn-Bp-yZPnN7FM607ueCv3VDDuXS_lMumXJZ6uOX56IY10&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-n08EqXNqeZE_HS99GTQi7-P1kkcox6t0ZQiXPIPqjhw&oe=6A28247D"}, {"file_name": "aDU9NY.png", "id": "513503572678353", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974624_513503576011686_5452742568917860352_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2rzVlD7e5_cQ7kNvwE8Hsm-&_nc_oc=AdqqIzckWZEB9UYKrqFgMqzRmILJnD4sqsBMNGsZOlVIShFS1TXQG7fOL0aY_twiZM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9-s4zlqkMhSGXVxT-FGU-8THYl7pH4I2jyolE8Jx2Ueg&oe=6A2822FE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/RTeFWd", "id": "276552923350738", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031433_276552926684071_5398554272214286336_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=auTr9U903D4Q7kNvwHFTqnM&_nc_oc=AdqWVOF05pH6XcEmDuJ5NnOU6xR-RZWQ5jYTYoQhxFCicS8Nt9wYUtOC6R9O3LrAgwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9tfHhTHQP7mo4iavjdZ28YtLDFxINCzjR2qsq4y3kj-w&oe=6A283689"}, "display_name": "Winery Tour in Georgia", "keywords": ["Wine", "Travel", "WineryTour", "Food", "History"], "long_description": "Georgian winemaking method is a part of UNESCO Intangible Heritage. It is the longest uninterrupted tradition of creating wine in the world. Georgia is also one of the oldest winegrowing countries - the pips of the grapes that have been found at Shulaveri Gora historical site are witnessing the fact that the locals were cultivating vines here around 8000 years ago.\nHow does a winery visit look like, once you're in Georgia? Of course, it's a bit of history, a bit of technology, and of course, some excellent food, drinks, songs, and toasts. Take a tour in Giuaani Winery in Manavi (Kakheti), discover more about the Georgian wine, and attend the friendly Georgian supra with the international visitors afterward!\nOf course, this is a demo version that gives you an idea about a half a day winery tour - it takes only one hour to get there from Tbilisi. But a deeper immersion will take you a bit longer. More wineries, more tastings, more exciting landscapes... Georgia is very diverse!", "short_description": "Visit Giuaani Winery in Kakheti with Trails and Wines, and learn more about the Georgian wine and winemaking peculiarities"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_pr